<tr><td>Noise</td><td>Low motor hum</td><td>Near silent with magnetic resistance</td></tr>
<tr><td>Setup</td><td>Outlet and cord route needed</td><td>Place it and go</td></tr>
<tr><td>Weight</td><td>Usually heavier</td><td>Ranges from light to heavy</td></tr>
<tr><td>Best for</td><td>Limited mobility, low stamina, steady pace</td><td>Calorie goals, calls, moving between rooms</td></tr>
</tbody></table></div>
